l}],"edges":[{"source":"aw15","target":"aw29","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"Akira's success and complex, mature themes paved the way for other ambitious anime features like Ghost in the Shell to get greenlit and find an international audience.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw15","target":"aw30","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The Wachowskis have cited Akira as a major influence, evident in The Matrix's cyberpunk aesthetic, philosophical questions about reality, and kinetic action sequences.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw15","target":"aw32","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The film's plot, which follows a troubled teenager who gains telekinetic powers and loses control, directly mirrors Tetsuo's character arc and the destructive consequences of unchecked power.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw15","target":"aw321","type":"influenced","label":"Influenced","note":"The character Eleven, a child with powerful psychokinetic abilities who escapes a secret government lab, strongly echoes the psychic espers (especially Akira himself) from the film.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw15","target":"aw15","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"The film is a direct adaptation by the original creator of his own epic manga series, though it condenses the sprawling narrative of the first half.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw15","target":"aw27","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"The film shares a strong aesthetic lineage with Blade Runner's vision of a futuristic, neon-drenched, multicultural metropolis struggling with urban decay.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw15","target":"aw15","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"The film is a direct adaptation by the original creator of his own epic manga series, though it condenses the sprawling narrative of the first half.","direction":"incoming"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw15","aw15","aw15","aw15","aw15","aw